      "mentions": [
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "char_shi_lei",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He then uses another move, earth’s root: countless spikes shoot from the thick robe, pierce the rats for over a dozen breaths, and kill them on the spot. When Seven Star Child’s immortal zombie finally drives the soul beast army and desolate beasts forward, Shi Lei peels the sticky robe off his body, covers the grotto-heaven loophole opening with it, presses both palms into the mud, and pours a large amount of immortal essence into that cover. Immortal killer move Earth Disintegration follows: the robe scatters and flows out, the crack widens into a huge hole, and another sky shows beyond it so he can force his way through.",
      "chapters": [
        727
